{"text": "PROCESS/TIMELINE\n2.27.2018\n\nGovernor approval of concepts \u2014 today\nRevisor has/gets revised language \u2014 working on it now\nLanguage and SONAR to Governor and MMB- end of April\nAssuming approval, ALJ gets language for non-substantive review (5 business days)\n\nPublish rule/Notice of Hearing \u2014 (need two weeks lead time) mid to end-May\no 230 days for comments\n\nHearings \u2014 > 31 days later (mid-July)\nPost-hearing comment period & rebuttal period (10-25 business days) August/Sept.\n\nALJ gets 30 days to complete report \u2014 October.\no Approve or approve with changes\n\nWe have 180 days to address changes if any. Hopefully won\u2019t need all of it. December\nGoes to Revisor\u2019s office\n\nBack to OAH \u2014 mid-end December\n\nSecretary of State and Governor for Signature January 1",
